# RNB batch (0.3.5): from fm1-build-status.md, "Style designs (for coding)". Gated 80s pop's Simmons noise plays
# only in every 4th bar (ZAP_RULES in gen.c), and only with the Simmons in the drum set.

style TIMBALAND
kick     X..x ...x ..x. .x..
snare    .... X... .... X.x.
rim      ..x. .x.. x..x ..x.
chat     x.xr x.x. xrx. x.rr
conga    .x.. ...x .x.. x...

style GATED
kick     X... .... X... ....
snare    .... X... .... X...
chat     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.
noise    .... .... .... X...
